					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 102000410,
					"content": "如果你们在蒙德周边逗留，也希望能够帮忙留意一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						102000411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 102000411,
					"content": "以你的「战力」，守护人们的安全，应当不成问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						102000412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 102000412,
					"content": "#好！如果能够把深渊教团解决掉的话，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}的排名又会上升一点吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						102000413,
						102000414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 102000413,
					"content": "没有那样的排名啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						102000415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 102000415,
					"content": "总之，打倒他们就对了啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						102000416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 102000416,
					"content": "哈，感觉被你们的干劲激励了呢。",
